{"duration": 57.397, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Secretary of War begged Congress for camels.", "start": 0.08, "end": 2.465}, {"beat": 0, "text": "Jefferson Davis wanted them to haul supplies across the desert Southwest.", "start": 2.685, "end": 6.848}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Soldiers stared at the humped beasts arriving from the Mediterranean.", "start": 7.268, "end": 10.712}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Mules were the Army way.", "start": 10.932, "end": 12.285}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Camels? Nobody knew how to handle them.", "start": 12.505, "end": 14.615}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Major Wayne shipped 34 camels to Texas in 1856.", "start": 15.035, "end": 18.962}, {"beat": 2, "text": "A second voyage brought 41 more.", "start": 19.182, "end": 21.108}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The herd reached 70.", "start": 21.328, "end": 22.537}, {"beat": 3, "text": "In 1857, Edward Beale led 25 camels on a wagon road survey.", "start": 22.957, "end": 27.648}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Each camel carried 600 pounds.", "start": 27.868, "end": 29.812}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Beale said one camel beat four mules.", "start": 30.032, "end": 32.063}, {"beat": 4, "text": "You see, a mule needs water and rest.", "start": 32.483, "end": 34.527}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Camels drink once, then keep walking for days.", "start": 34.747, "end": 37.374}, {"beat": 5, "text": "In 1859, Lieutenant Hartz marched camels 85 miles with no water.", "start": 37.794, "end": 42.487}, {"beat": 5, "text": "They showed no thirst.", "start": 42.707, "end": 43.921}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Horses and mules arrived distressed; camels did not.", "start": 44.141, "end": 47.204}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The Army still said no.", "start": 47.624, "end": 48.888}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Then the Civil War hit.", "start": 49.108, "end": 50.372}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Camels were sold at auction in 1864.", "start": 50.592, "end": 53.257}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The last one was seen in Arizona in 1891.", "start": 53.477, "end": 56.277}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Secretary", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.72, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "of", "start": 0.745, "end": 0.82, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "War", "start": 0.87, "end": 1.045, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "begged", "start": 1.095, "end": 1.345, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Congress", "start": 1.395, "end": 1.795, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "for", "start": 1.845, "end": 1.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "camels.", "start": 1.995, "end": 2.533, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Jefferson", "start": 2.729, "end": 3.254, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Davis", "start": 3.304, "end": 3.879, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wanted", "start": 3.979, "end": 4.204, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "them", "start": 4.229, "end": 4.379, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 4.429, "end": 4.504, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "haul", "start": 4.554, "end": 4.779, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "supplies", "start": 4.829, "end": 5.379, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "across", "start": 5.429, "end": 5.729, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "the", "start": 5.779, "end": 5.829, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "desert", "start": 5.879, "end": 6.204, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Southwest.", "start": 6.254, "end": 6.866, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Soldiers", "start": 7.358, "end": 7.833, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "stared", "start": 7.908, "end": 8.208, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "at", "start": 8.233, "end": 8.283, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 8.308, "end": 8.358, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "humped", "start": 8.408, "end": 8.658, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "beasts", "start": 8.708, "end": 9.258, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "arriving", "start": 9.333, "end": 9.758, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "from", "start": 9.808, "end": 9.925, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 9.925, "end": 9.983, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Mediterranean.", "start": 10.033, "end": 10.766, "line": 2, "b